admin    IN  CNAME   intranet.domain0053.test.
intranet IN  A       10.10.19.44
api    IN  A       10.10.113.102
www    IN  A       10.10.240.120
www    IN  A       10.10.58.158
test    IN  A       10.10.36.148
mail    IN  A       10.10.87.195
@       IN  MX 10   mail.domain0053.test.
